@startuml notification-sequence
' Status: Draft - Reconciliation Incomplete. AI-reconciled; not human reviewed (Principle VII).
' Written source: contracts/service-contracts.md, DEC-16, DEC-17
title Notification Creation, Retrieval, and Read Marking\nFR-017, FR-019, FR-023; in-app only, ID-08 (conditional draft: OC-1 open)

participant "DefaultExpenseService\nDefaultApprovalService" as Caller
participant "NotificationDispatcher" as Disp
database "MembershipRepository" as Members
database "NotificationRepository" as Repo
actor "Recipient" as User
participant "HomePanel\nNotificationsPanel" as Panel
participant "NotificationController\n(via UiTaskRunner)" as Ctrl
participant "NotificationService" as Svc
participant "AccessPolicy" as Access

== New expense, inside the creating transaction (FR-017) ==
Caller -> Disp : expenseCreated(expense)
Disp -> Members : listActiveMembers(group)
Members --> Disp : active members only
note right of Disp
  Every active member except the creator.
  Former members receive nothing (Story 7 scenario 4).
  Message: creator, group, description, amount, date.
end note
Disp -> Repo : insertAll(EXPENSE_CREATED rows)
alt write fails
  Repo --> Caller : RepositoryException
  note over Caller : The whole transaction rolls back, so no expense\nexists without its notifications (SC-006).
else written
  Repo --> Caller : committed with the expense
end

== Pending edit, inside the editing transaction (DEC-16) ==
Caller -> Disp : expenseEdited(expense, addedParticipants)
loop each added participant other than the creator
  Disp -> Repo : findCreatedForRecipient(expenseId, userId)
  alt row exists
    Disp -> Repo : resetToUnread(id)
  else no row
    Disp -> Repo : insertAll(new EXPENSE_CREATED row)
  end
end
note right of Disp : Other rows stay as created.\nA decision always opens live detail.

== Decision, inside the deciding transaction (FR-023) ==
Caller -> Disp : expenseDecided(expense, decision)
Disp -> Repo : insertAll(EXPENSE_APPROVED or EXPENSE_REJECTED for the creator)
note right of Disp : Includes the reason, if any.

== At login and on return to Home (FR-019) ==
User -> Panel : log in, or return to Home
Panel -> Ctrl : refresh
Ctrl -> Svc : unreadCount(session)
Svc -> Access : visibleScope(session)
Access --> Svc : scope
Svc -> Repo : countUnread(user, scope)
Repo --> Svc : count
Svc --> Ctrl : count
Ctrl --> Panel : show count
note right of Panel : Items from while logged out appear here.\nOne user at a time, so no polling (DEC-03).

== Open the list (FR-019) ==
User -> Panel : open Notifications
Panel -> Ctrl : load
Ctrl -> Svc : list(session)
Svc -> Access : visibleScope(session)
Svc -> Repo : listForRecipient(user, scope)
Repo --> Svc : rows, newest first
note right of Svc
  needsApproval is computed on each read:
  type = EXPENSE_CREATED, and the expense is PENDING,
  and the recipient is a participant other than the creator.
  A deleted expense shows "(expense deleted)" and no flag.
  Former members see rows only for expenses they were part of (DEC-07).
end note
Svc --> Ctrl : NotificationView list
Ctrl --> Panel : render; flag is text, not color alone

== Mark read (FR-019) ==
User -> Panel : mark read
Panel -> Ctrl : selected ids
Ctrl -> Svc : markRead(session, ids)
Svc -> Repo : markRead(user, ids, now)
note right of Repo : Restricted to rows of the recipient;\nother IDs are ignored.
Svc --> Ctrl : done; count refreshes

@enduml
